== Equipment ==
* Armor Full Blessed or Full Vanguard
* Martial Weapon of Enchanting
* Shield of Fortitude (+10ar vs. Fire)
* Staff of enchanting +20e 

== Usage ==
* Start from Doomlore with quest Veiled Threat. Run south through Dalada, Grothmar & Sacnoth to dungeon. Alcohol helps at Sacnoth for KD prevention.
* Maintain [[gww:Shadow Form|Shadow Form]], [[gww:Shroud of Distress|Shroud of Distress]], [[gww:Dwarven Stability|Dwarven Stability]] and [[gww:Dark Escape|Dark Escape]] while running.
=== Level 1 ===
* Pop BU and other cons (cupcake or armor of salvation), cast shroud, sf, ds and de grab a keg and run it wall down the hill.
* After the wall crumbles run to the Keg Station and keg spam the melee char.
* After the melee are dead run into next room. Silver the melee with all enchants up then loose aggro. Snipe w/o sf the Prophet->Necro->Flameshielders. Then kill the Warden. A summon stone will help.
* Aggro the melee in Rragars chamber and sliver them down. Sliver Rragar down and grab the key.
* Run back to where wall crumbled and take a right then stay left until u get to another keg station.
* Keg spam melee then take a keg to the cracked wall and drop it.
* Once wall crumbles stay right until the last chamber then stay left til zone.

=== Level 2 ===
* Pop BU and run right.
* Run down towards the water and take right followed by immediate left. Avoid the sewer and continue straight towards chamber with 2 bridges.
* Take left bridge then stay right to Rragars' chamber.
* Sliver melee in Rragars' chamber then sliver Rragar. Grab the Key.
* Follow Rragar to the gate, making sure not to get body blocked. 
* Open gate and proceed to lvl 3.

=== Level 3 ===
* Pop BU and run to the left.
* In the chamber of the second rez shrine there is a Keg Station. Next to this station is a breakable wall.
* Cast enchantments and dark escape and near the wall to the char pop. Then keg spam the melee.
* After the melee are dead run past the wall to the Flesheater boss group.
* Sliver the boss group hound 1st->harrows->bosses using the 1st group you come across as sliver fuel.
:* Make sure to avoid standing near corpses as Bosses will use putrid explosion. 
* Once boss group is dead, grab the key and run back past the keg station and north east through the firefly rooms.
* Head north until you see the gate lock. Proceed through it and take a right into the boss chamber.
* Kill Rragar 1st using sniper and sliver. (a summon stone speeds up the process.. ghastly is a good choice)
* After Rragar is dead use alcohol with dwarven stability to avoid KD and kill Hidesplitter.

==Ranger Usage==
* Start from Doomlore with quest Veiled Threat. Run south through Dalada, Grothmar & Sacnoth to dungeon. Alcohol helps at Sacnoth for KD prevention.
* Maintain [[gww:Shadow Form|Shadow Form]], [[gww:Shroud of Distress|Shroud of Distress]] and [[gww:Dwarven Stability|Dwarven Stability]] (with alcohol) while running.
=== Level 1 ===
* Pop cons, cast shroud, sf, ds and de grab a keg and run it to the wall down the hill.
* After the wall crumbles run to Keg Station and keg spam the melee char.
* After the melee are dead run into next room. Sniper the monk and the necromancer without SF. If you have a low ebon rank you might need FH to finish them off. After that whirl everything down and finish off the boss with EVSS.
* Jump to Rragar and whirl him down.
* Run back to where wall crumbled and take a right then stay left until you get to another keg station.
* Keg spam the melee then take a keg to the wall and drop it.
* Once wall crumbles stay right until the last chamber then stay left til zone.

=== Level 2 ===
* Pop cons and run right.
* Run down towards water and take right followed by immediate left. Avoid the sewer and continue straight towards chamber with 2 bridges.
* Take left bridge then stay right to Rragars' chamber.
* Whirl Rragar.
* Follow Rragar making sure not to get body blocked to the gate. 
* Open gate and proceed to lvl 3.

=== Level 3 ===
* Pop Cons and run to the left.
* In the chamber of the second rez shrine there is a Keg Station. Next to this station is a breakable wall.
* A group breaks the wall, run past them.
* Run to the Flesheater boss group.
* Whirl the boss group hound 1st->harrows->bosses using the 1st group you come across as sliver fuel, make sure to HoS when health drops. 
:* Make sure to avoid standing near corpses as Bosses will use putrid explosion. 
* Once boss group is dead, grab the key and run back past the keg station and north east through the firefly rooms.
* Head north until you see the gate lock. Proceed through it and take a right into the boss chamber.
* Kill Rragar 1st using sniper.
* After Rragar is dead use alcohol with dwarven stability to avoid KD and kill Hidesplitter, (a summon stone speeds up the process.. ghastly is a good choice)

